fn a2_mov ins edit ulong 8192 meta edit ulong 512 dop ulong aop ulong to void
a2_imadi edit ins edit meta dop aop 1 A2_NOREG
end

fn a2_shr ins edit ulong 8192 meta edit ulong 512 d ulong aop ulong imm ulong to void
r = new ulong 8 0
a2_r0 edit r 17
put r 1 d
put r 2 and aop 0xffff
put r 6 imm
put r 7 shl shr aop 16 24
a2_emit edit ins edit meta view r 0
end

fn a2_andi ins edit ulong 8192 meta edit ulong 512 dop ulong aop ulong imm ulong to void
